     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ServiceRequest example-prior-drp-clinical-imaging</b></p><a name=\"example-prior-drp-clinical-imaging\"> </a><a name=\"hcexample-prior-drp-clinical-imaging\"> </a><div style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #d9e0e7; padding: 6px; margin: 4px; border: 1px solid #8da1b4; border-radius: 5px; line-height: 60%\"><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"/><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">Profile: <a href=\"StructureDefinition-ereferral-servicerequest-diagnosticimaging.html\">EReferralServiceRequestDiagnosticImaging</a></p></div><p><b>BeValidityPeriod</b>: 2025-11-18 --&gt; 2026-11-18</p><p><b>status</b>: Active</p><p><b>intent</b>: Order</p><p><b>category</b>: <span title=\"Codes:{https://www.ehealth.fgov.be/standards/fhir/terminology/CodeSystem/be-cs-prescription-type diagnostic-imaging-appendix-82}\">Diagnostic imaging (Appendix 82)</span>, <span title=\"Codes:{http://snomed.info/sct 363679005}\">Imaging</span>, <span title=\"Codes:{https://www.ehealth.fgov.be/standards/fhir/terminology/CodeSystem/be-cs-request-track ambulatory}\">Ambulatory</span></p><p><b>priority</b>: Routine</p><p><b>code</b>: <span title=\"Codes:{http://snomed.info/sct 32962002}\">Computed tomography of abdomen with contrast (procedure)</span></p><p><b>subject</b>: <a href=\"#hcexample-prior-drp-clinical-imaging/prior-imaging-patient\">Anonymous Patient (no stated gender), DoB:  ( https://www.ehealth.fgov.be/standards/fhir/core/NamingSystem/ssin#BeSSINNamingSystem#urn:be:fgov:pseudo:v2:{{SEC1}}:{{transit-info}} (use: official))</a></p><p><b>authoredOn</b>: 2025-11-18 09:30:00+0100</p><p><b>requester</b>: <a href=\"PractitionerRole-72101230445-PHYSICIAN.html\">Physician Example (official) (https://www.ehealth.fgov.be/standards/fhir/core/NamingSystem/ssin#BeSSINNamingSystem#72101230445 (use: official)): physician</a></p><p><b>reasonCode</b>: <span title=\"Codes:\">urn:be:fgov:pseudo-